# Reunite (Vercel) — environment variables
# 1. Create a free Neon Postgres database at https://neon.tech
#    (or use Vercel Storage → Postgres). Copy the pooled connection string.
# 2. Paste it below and set it in Vercel Project Settings → Environment Variables.
DATABASE_URL="postgresql://user:password@ep-xxx-pooler.region.aws.neon.tech/reunite?sslmode=require"
